        "visitorCountParagraph": "Cloudflare Workers and KV storage are used to maintain the existing aggregate visitor count shown on the home page. During visitor-request processing, the Worker combines the IP address, browser information (User-Agent), and language information, then converts the value into a one-way hash to check duplicate visits for five minutes. The original IP address and browser information are not stored, and the duplicate-check hash key expires automatically after five minutes. Only the numeric total is stored for the aggregate visitor count.",
